From 3de3688fcd858f5f044f85eba9513c8877e8862d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Faeton Danishevskyi <faeton@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:26:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add reboot credential

An alternate owner credential that reboots the device instead of
wiping it. Checked after the duress credentials, on the same
background thread. Enrolment needs the owner credential and rejects
collisions with it, the second-factor PIN and the duress credentials.

cmd lock_settings set-reboot-credential for scripted enrolment.
